# Generated from contracts/ by the build's own `prepare` hook — never ship the host's copy into the image,
# or the client would mirror whatever was last generated on a laptop instead of the specs in this tree.
src/web/src/api/generated
src/admin-web/src/api/generated
# Where the code surfaces lived before ADR 0106 stage 2. Nothing tracked is there any more, but an existing checkout
# keeps its ignored leftovers (node_modules/, build/, a stale generated client) until they are deleted by hand, and
# none of that may enter an image. Root-anchored: these name the old root directories, never src/'s.
/web
/admin-web
/backend
/packages
**/.cache
**/.vite

*.log

**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

backups
infra/backups
